    {
      "text": "Alex",
      "sha256": "db74c940d447e877d119df613edd2700c4a84cd1cf08beb7cbc319bcfaeab97a",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:13:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alex attend Xavier devant la gare avec deux valises.",
      "sha256": "e7c8fffd2c45693d9f657ab10e2d580cafb3e47234b97779f4a334fabacf5cdb",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:13:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[1].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alex confirme l'adresse et ils montent dans le taxi.",
      "sha256": "4f4ed8e73cc0bf409880f5a86c564c31098b3edcf9a344c08c81d132433f9c9b",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:13:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alex et Xavier attendent devant la gare.",
      "sha256": "c4076f47624e16a0a6f0b23a0bbca88e541c591fc8c05de8956c478a630ca53e",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:13:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Après le spectacle, nous entrons dans le stade pour voir le match.",
      "sha256": "e163d7afb42e3aa710ee9d3dd8a63e5583273077515c39ec9b447f2e16e87796",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:15:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Au marché du livre, je demande un grand sac pour mes achats.",
      "sha256": "2fa79e357e2976129be03d7f9e4e58fa3ef0f5ff120dcee34f6e3a62aa0d5867",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:14:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[1].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonjour, Alex et Xavier attendent devant la gare.",
      "sha256": "d534d72ccfe02278b654af851ac275dd25fcbe70dbc86d6a9b90d6e6aa84d9bc",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:13:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonjour, je viens avec neuf livres à emporter.",
      "sha256": "35515869596557fb0eb137879facbe05e89eed21c05a53d9a5edd80301cda48d",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:14:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonjour, la station est-elle près du stade ?",
      "sha256": "8adb1d9f76abe719f9d4efcf482cc02435f1477eac3f1bbe9f72c528bf68a3b8",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:15:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ce sac est neuf.",
      "sha256": "cc73ec743f9194e992c198a3bf855976fb019ead124c2e4e0825e89db30f0d21",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:14:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[10].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ce spectacle a un style spécial.",
      "sha256": "89e70a057a5b0ce4780cc2e9a20c686f4371e7930624d67e0060ceee789fa49b",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:15:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "J'ai deux adresses sur mon téléphone.",
      "sha256": "7ac96d815c076f0c850fc7361e6d2a44fa2772b655d782c0db2021efd46cb2b1",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:13:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je prends un grand sac.",
      "sha256": "417b32c78a53030b5c0299fc7c1a924182dbacf6040a0d0df15bc39803c661e6",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:14:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je repars avec neuf livres dans un sac plus grand.",
      "sha256": "a0f086a369348841944972ab942ea5c39769b14681a9ce9eaeb106c2dadc499d",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:14:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[3].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je vais au stade après le spectacle.",
      "sha256": "64396016c44a2a620ddcf26ef71b8ae882791ff7f47073561bc1b683e6feacb7",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:15:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[10].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Je viens avec neuf livres.",
      "sha256": "30e4fc77043c8762ce860157ddef4ccd6dc314b5d055a6a89f9947a23772cee6",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:14:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[9].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "La station est près du stade.",
      "sha256": "d5c1f0918798ac4e0e91b08d712d114f36b01eab6697b94e118eabba8a356523",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:15:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le groupe a un style spécial que tout le monde remarque.",
      "sha256": "a491d83f7427fe1d3743a0c6686d080ed73396c5af0b78578323b175d2136c84",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:15:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[3].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le petit sac est trop plein.",
      "sha256": "32303171745303a3e06a4b1fbcff8c054a27b2b534236d48024ad9ed61f9ed70",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:14:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[8].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le taxi arrive dans dix minutes, mais le chauffeur demande l'adresse exacte.",
      "sha256": "fff8f11fc276fced19f4d011899de716ee3b76767baece2dd4738ecbf7090282",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:13:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le taxi arrive dans dix minutes.",
      "sha256": "a9d307708d677d17d90b74167e40b39e606cb294351fde24bd40d908c151cc0f",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:13:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le vendeur me dit que ce sac est neuf.",
      "sha256": "c4e0e3086c76a3832d8a79adabf67ccd90395a38008b9c0d35b2981f94316d91",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:14:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[4].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Le vendeur me donne d'abord un petit sac, mais il est trop plein.",
      "sha256": "17d6e5f2ff06eab315ebf76237d4d7cfd2b85874dfd15248eaa0ecdeeddee88d",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:14:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Merci, je prends ce grand sac.",
      "sha256": "1e8e2cb2ead6ef9662b37df219357e336702f2f0bf05e37a56f9afe084b29981",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:14:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Merci, je vais au stade après le spectacle.",
      "sha256": "4e94a4c251aab9e729e41a629813a9c24a6ef4579ebfc901651d2b334ce0929a",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:15:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Merci, voici l'endroit exact sur la carte.",
      "sha256": "78d917eb93527ea443dae2eb4e6e06de5002920b4ffafb417f930d166c95fb30",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:13:fr-en",
          "field": "speaking.closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nous faisons du sport au stade.",
      "sha256": "05d625cbc419d520e70a1414b77e09d7484b7acda4650ca714a5b17c5c69762d",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:15:fr-en",
          "field": "cards[7].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nous sortons de la station et marchons vers le stade.",
      "sha256": "70ff51c01de2536fca8fced0cf302f5a2424c8e5ff74128caa6923cfe409ac90",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:15:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[1].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Un spectacle de danse commence avant le match de football.",
      "sha256": "de8b1d455bab5ea1d90592799dd5e7b66b48e768af3210c7f5b18affafc02514",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "lessonId": "core-french-sound-like-a-native:15:fr-en",
          "field": "reader[2].fr"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Voici l'endroit exact sur la carte.",
      "sha256": "192b526001db9e92a25d0739a53649e2fa652df0f09755e4ad0d6615bf14ba6c",
      "occurrences": [
